&Acme Robotics Inc. -- Company Overview	heading-1¼
2°
¢Acme Robotics Inc. designs and manufactures autonomous warehouse robots for logistics and fulfillment operations. Founded in 2015, the company serves customers across North America, EMEA, APAC, and LATAM through three business segments: Hardware, Software Subscriptions, and Field Services.	paragraph*
3„
wOur mission is to make warehouse automation accessible to mid-sized distribution operators, not just large enterprises.	paragraph*$
4
Risk Factors	paragraph*ç
5Û
ÍThe company's revenue is concentrated among a small number of large logistics customers; the loss of any single major customer could materially affect quarterly results. Component costs for LIDAR sensors have historically been volatile, and prolonged supply shortages have previously delayed hardware shipments by up to two quarters.	paragraph*Å	
