Leadership Team	heading-1Ê
1128»
­Acme Robotics is led by CEO Maria Chen, who co-founded the company in 2015 after a decade in industrial automation. CTO Daniel Osei leads hardware engineering, and CFO Priya Ramanathan oversees finance and investor relations. The executive team is based at the company's headquarters in Austin, Texas.	paragraph**

1129ÿ
Company History	heading-1à
1130Ñ
ÃAcme Robotics was founded in 2015 as a two-person startup building a single prototype warehouse robot. The company shipped its first commercial unit in 2017, opened its EMEA office in 2019, and expanded into APAC and LATAM in 2021 and 2023 respectively. The company has never had a full-year revenue decline since founding.	paragraph**
»
1131¬
Sustainability Report	heading-1‡
1132ø
êAcme Robotics committed in 2023 to reducing manufacturing energy consumption per unit by 30% by 2028. The company's primary manufacturing facility runs partially on solar power, and packaging materials are fully recyclable as of 2024.	paragraph**
à
1133Ñ
Competitive Landscape	heading-1¬
1134
The warehouse robotics market includes several established competitors focused on larger enterprise deployments. Acme Robotics differentiates itself by targeting mid-sized distribution operators with lower upfront hardware costs and a simpler software subscription model.	paragraph**